WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.720
For Moya Clinic operations committee, the
immediate friction is monthly site reports
are split across five clinic spreadsheets.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:18.380
The recurring cost is not only the task
itself. It is the repeated effort needed
to reconstruct context, check the work and
prepare something another person can
safely review.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:29.200
Mobile Care is used to provide scheduled
primary-care appointments at five
community sites. The bounded result is one
monthly view of scheduled and completed
appointments.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.500
The claim has to survive inspection: the
September service log records 240
completed appointments.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.840
The system prepares a bounded review
state; the authorised human keeps
judgement and release.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.460
The next step is request the next-quarter
schedule.
